From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/adreno: turn GPU preemption off by default

Not for upstream as is: this is the OnePlus Pad 4 (A840) queue's
default, until A8xx preemption is fixed.

On A840 (ADRENO_QUIRK_PREEMPTION, with IFPC) the auto default gives the
GPU four rings, and a8xx_preempt_trigger() fenced-writes
CP_CONTEXT_SWITCH_SMMU_INFO (0x8c1) while the GX can be in IFPC. The
writes then land late ("delay in fenced register write (0x8c1)", three
in 16 minutes of desktop use), the GPU went through recoveries, and
every recovery counts as a context loss for all users of the reset
status, so Chromium / Electron applications drop their GPU process.
Booted with msm.enable_preemption=0 the same installed system logged no
fenced-write delay, no GPU fault and no recovery, and the desktop felt
smoother.

Change the default of enable_preemption from -1 (auto) to 0, which is
exactly the tested msm.enable_preemption=0 state. The parameter stays:
msm.enable_preemption=1 turns preemption back on, -1 restores the
per-GPU quirk choice. The default changes for every GPU because the
parameter is also read by msm_submitqueue_create(), so a per-GPU
default would not match the tested state; this kernel only drives an
A840.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Claude
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
index 7108d4aa59b5..bf86b6cacf0e 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
@@ -16,8 +16,8 @@ bool snapshot_debugbus = false;
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(snapshot_debugbus, "Include debugbus sections in GPU devcoredump (if not fused off)");
 module_param_named(snapshot_debugbus, snapshot_debugbus, bool, 0600);
 
-int enable_preemption = -1;
-MODULE_PARM_DESC(enable_preemption, "Enable preemption (A7xx+ only) (1=on , 0=disable, -1=auto (default))");
+int enable_preemption;
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(enable_preemption, "Enable preemption (A7xx+ only) (1=on, 0=disable (default), -1=auto)");
 module_param(enable_preemption, int, 0600);
 
 bool disable_acd;
